# One town clears its offer in {natFastestMoEn} months, another in {natSlowestMoEn}

At the close of the quarter the supply of new-build flats in Slovakia stood at {natStockEn} across {natTowns} towns. Average prices and the size of the offer differ between them, but the largest difference is not in price — it is in how fast that offer sells.

At the current pace of sales the offer in {natFastest} would clear in {natFastestMoEn} months. In {natSlowest} it would take {natSlowestMoEn}, a factor of {natSpreadEn}. {natFastest} averages {natFastestM2} €/m² incl. VAT and {natSlowest} {natSlowestM2} €/m² incl. VAT.

